  "prefLabel": "He-C 6355.05 Length of Certification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6355.05 Length of Certification. Certification shall be valid for 2 years from the date issued, unless certification is voluntarily surrendered by the foster care program, the program closes, or the program’s certification is revoked by the department pursuant to He-C 6355.29.\n\nSource. #8696, eff 7-29-06; ss by #10640, INTERIM, eff 7-29-14, EXPIRED: 1-26-15\n\nNew. #10783, eff 2-13-15; ss by #14224, INTERIM, eff 3-29-25, EXPIRES: 9-25-25",
